<BilingualNote frontmatter={note}>
  <div data-lang="en">
    <p>I work on browser analytics. On the web, a click and the page it opens share a navigation. I can look at the URL. Mobile ads do not work that way, and the explanations I found kept replacing one unfamiliar word with another. This is the account I can defend from public documentation. I checked those pages on 10 November 2026.</p>
    <p>Alex is a person I invented, with their own iPhone. Cosmere is an app I invented. Campaign 456 is a campaign number I invented. Where I need a real company’s behavior, I use AppsFlyer as the example of a mobile measurement partner, because AppsFlyer and Amplitude both publish the integration. I do not claim that Adjust, Branch, or anyone else uses the same screens or the same forwarding rules.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-lang="zh">
    <p>我做的是浏览器里的分析。在网页上，一次点击和它打开的页面属于同一次跳转，我可以看着那条 URL。手机广告不是这样。我读到的解释，常常是用一个陌生的词去替换另一个陌生的词。下面是我能用公开文档撑住的版本。这些页面是我在 2026 年 11 月 10 日核对的。</p>
    <p>Alex 是我虚构的人，用的是自己的 iPhone。Cosmere 是我虚构的应用。广告系列 456 是我虚构的编号。需要举一家真实公司时，我用 AppsFlyer 作为移动监测合作伙伴的例子，因为 AppsFlyer 和 Amplitude 都公开写了这条集成。我没有说 Adjust、Branch 或其他公司使用同样的界面或同样的转发规则。</p>
  </div>

  <div data-lang="en">
    <h2>After the install, where did campaign 456 go?</h2>
    <p>Alex opens Instagram and sees an ad for Cosmere. The ad belongs to Meta campaign 456. Alex taps it, lands on Cosmere’s page in the App Store, installs, and opens Cosmere for the first time. The Cosmere developer embedded two pieces of code: an MMP SDK, and a separate Amplitude SDK.</p>
    <p>The sentence people want at the end is “this Cosmere install is campaign 456.” That sentence has to be split. It might be true inside the MMP, for this app install, under one specific path. It is not a statement that anyone learned Alex’s name. It is not automatically true inside Amplitude. And on some paths the result is only a delayed, aggregated count, or no match at all.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-lang="zh">
    <h2>装完以后，广告系列 456 去了哪里？</h2>
    <p>Alex 打开 Instagram，看到一条 Cosmere 广告。这条广告属于 Meta 的广告系列 456。Alex 点下去，来到 App Store 里的 Cosmere 页面，安装，然后第一次打开 Cosmere。Cosmere 的开发者在应用里放了两段代码：一段 MMP SDK，另一段是单独的 Amplitude SDK。</p>
    <p>大家想听到的结尾是“这次 Cosmere 安装就是广告系列 456”。这句话必须拆开。它也许在 MMP 内部、对这一次应用安装、在某一条特定路径上成立。它不是“有人知道了 Alex 的名字”。它也不会自动在 Amplitude 里成立。还有一些路径只给出延迟的汇总数字，或者根本对不上。</p>
  </div>

  <div data-lang="en">
    <h2>Who is actually in the room</h2>
    <p>An MMP, a mobile measurement partner, is a company an app developer hires to decide which ads to credit for installs and later in-app actions. AppsFlyer is one. The MMP SDK is that company’s code inside Cosmere. The MMP backend is that company’s servers. Matching is a job those servers do. The attribution result is data the MMP backend produces and, sometimes, sends onward. It is not another company.</p>
    <p>Meta is the ad platform in this story. Instagram is Meta’s app on the phone. Meta’s backend is off the phone. Those are the same owner, which is why they share a color on the map.</p>
    <p>The App Store client is Apple’s store app on the phone. It shows a product page and installs an app. Apple’s attribution service, AdAttributionKit and the older SKAdNetwork, is a different thing. It sits off the phone and produces a privacy-preserving postback. I drew it separately so it would not look like the store app was secretly passing campaign 456 into the binary.</p>
    <p>The Amplitude SDK is also inside Cosmere, and it has a different owner. It sends product events, such as “the app opened,” to Amplitude’s backend. Amplitude’s attribution endpoint is only a network door. It receives a message. It does not watch Instagram.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-lang="zh">
    <h2>房间里到底有谁</h2>
    <p>MMP，也就是移动监测合作伙伴，是应用开发者请来判断“哪条广告该记上这次安装、以及之后的应用内行为”的公司。AppsFlyer 是其中一家。MMP SDK 是这家公司放在 Cosmere 里的代码。MMP 后端是这家公司的服务器。匹配是这些服务器做的一项工作。归因结果是 MMP 后端产生、有时再转发出去的数据。它不是另一家公司。</p>
    <p>在这个故事里，Meta 是广告平台。Instagram 是 Meta 装在手机上的应用。Meta 后端在手机之外。它们是同一个所有者，所以在图上用同一种颜色。</p>
    <p>App Store 客户端是手机上的 Apple 商店应用。它展示产品页并安装应用。Apple 的归因服务，也就是 AdAttributionKit 和更早的 SKAdNetwork，是另一件事。它在手机之外，生成一份保护隐私的回传。我把它单独画出来，免得看起来像商店应用偷偷把广告系列 456 塞进了安装包。</p>
    <p>Amplitude SDK 也在 Cosmere 里面，但所有者不同。它把产品事件，例如“应用被打开了”，发给 Amplitude 后端。Amplitude 的归因接口只是一扇网络上的门。它接收一条消息。它并不看着 Instagram。</p>
  </div>

